    "article_summary": "The article describes the translation of a dual photoredox and nickel-catalyzed C(sp2)-C(sp3) decarboxylative cross-coupling from batch to continuous flow. By identifying a flow-compatible base (DBU) and solvent (DMA), the authors achieved a significant reduction in reaction time (from 72 hours to 20-30 minutes) and a 430-fold increase in space-time yield, facilitating the multigram synthesis of medicinal chemistry building blocks.",
